            <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
              <strong>CAGR:</strong> The annualized geometric growth rate dampening multi-year market volatility into a smoothed constant annual percentage rate.<br />
              <strong>WACC:</strong> A company's blended cost of capital across equity and tax-shielded corporate debt, used as the benchmark discount rate for DCF and NPV valuations.
            </p>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-center">
